  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Revert Npcap to 1.80 to workaround bugs",
  "description": "This reverts npcap back to 1.80.\n\nThere is a bug in 1.81/1.82/1.83 where all incoming packets sniffed (at least on a WiFi interface) are appended an empty Vlan0 header. This has been reported over https://github.com/nmap/npcap/issues/805\n\nWhile this isn't breaking, I fear that this will raise many issues from users using 4.5.0+. In the meantime I would suggest to stick to 1.80.",
