        {
          "id": 2665221026,
          "type": null,
          "body": "> There is a bug in 1.81/1.82/1.83 where all incoming packets sniffed (at least on a WiFi interface) are appended an empty Vlan0 header\n\nI can't replicate this issue, using a Wi-Fi interface and windows and Npcap 1.82. I would like to wait for someone else to replicate the issue that you reported to Npcap before reverting, as the release does fix other issues. The problem may be particular to your driver or something else.",
